Generic single-database configuration with async support for SQLAlchemy 2.0.

## Usage

### Create a new migration

```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"
```

### Apply migrations

```bash
# Upgrade to latest
alembic upgrade head

# Upgrade one version
alembic upgrade +1

# Downgrade one version
alembic downgrade -1
```

### View migration history

```bash
alembic history
alembic current
```

### Rollback

```bash
# Rollback to specific revision
alembic downgrade <revision_id>

# Rollback all
alembic downgrade base
```

